<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 92,613.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 92,613.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Jan 14 totaled 92,613 bales, up from 92,027 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 586 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 2,396 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
